FOSHAN CITY DOPRO FURNITURE CO.,LTD

Founded in 2012, Foshan City Dopro furniture Co., LTD was located in the largest furniture manufacture hub -Longjiang town Shunde district, Foshan city ,Guangdong province ; Our company is the enterprise of R&D, production , trading and post-service ;

We are specialized in producing stainless steel furniture, hardware furniture involved and our products series :DP-S sofas, DP-C coffee tables &chairs, DP-X entrance, DP-D dining tables &chairs; DP-T Tv cabinets, DP-F end tables, DP-B negotiation tables&chairs, DP-Y chairs (wedding chair ,church chairs ,leisure chairs and so on )

