We insist on management policy of“honesty, innovation, development and win-win“, based on advanced production management and excellence design team,through persist 8years hard-works, we exported our products to UK,Russia ,South Africa ,Australia,Indonesia ,India,Pakistan ,Saudi Arabia ,Mongolia,Ethiopia and so on with our best quality ,newest design and reasonable price ;

Our DOPRO FURNITURE seek the common development with all clients from the whole world！

Yuxi (International) Furniture Industry, as a modern enterprise integrating design, production, sales, and service, specializes in the production of fabric soft sofas, soft beds, and hardware series products. It fully adopts modern design concepts and embodies the unique characteristics of simplicity, postmodernism, and nobility in its products. In the production process, it strictly adheres to the quality management system of "ISO9001" and has always maintained the quality policy of "survival through quality and development through products", continuously meeting the needs of customers and being well received by customers at home and abroad.

The existing standard factory covers an area of 100000 square meters and has more than 200 high-quality management backbone and professional technical personnel, with a total of more than 1000 employees. It also has a strong design team, including famous German furniture designers Tidn, Peter Marigold, Thonos Zakopoulos

The enterprise is now facing the world. We have launched four major series of products, including two sofa brands, "Everby BMW" and "Gami", a soft bed brand, and a hardware furniture brand, "Everby Bao'er"
The main focus of "Everby BMW" is on sofas that are "elegant, grand, noble, and postmodern";
Gami "is a sofa that is" simple, bright, modern, and warm ";
The 'Kuju' soft bed adopts a stress relieving, modern, fashionable, and minimalist style;
Everby Boer "mainly promotes fashion and modern hardware and glass furniture. The product has been exported to various parts of the world.

Fashionable BAM, a leading German company in design, has been active in the international high-end market. The product has successively served the upper echelons of society, sports stars, etc. It enjoys a high reputation in the international market with a high-end luxury brand image comparable to Mercedes Benz, BMW, etc. Fashionable BAM has always been praised by sports stars, movie stars, and other high society as a furniture brand with urban aristocratic charm, and its requirements for furniture are also simple. This "minimalist+luxurious" lifestyle has become a global trend.
Our company adheres to the business philosophy of "survival through quality, cooperation through reputation, and development through innovation", and sincerely welcomes friends from all over the world to visit and negotiate, work together, and develop together.
